Test file: `Blockchain/Dev/services/originate/src/__tests__/ks1364-v2-verification-verify-body-required.test.ts`  (NEW, 46 lines)
Tip: `0736d8b7849ef6c725c891d7254f2a3e21f42eb6` (origin develop, `git ls-remote` 2026-10-01 17:43 AEST; #1365, the base Wednesday named). `originate.openapi.ts` there is 3934 lines.
