Written 2026-10-01 17:54 AEST by a Spark brief-writer sub-agent for Wednesday (KS-1364 batch 3), from `0736d8b7`, `originate.openapi.ts` read at every line named here and the handler read. Source: KS-1364 (In Progress, assigned to Kamil; created by Peter 2026-09-28 with the sweep-4 evidence). Carve: this brief takes ONE operation, `POST /api/v2/verification/verify`, from the ticket's 17-operation table.

## The mode - read this twice

CODE+TEST. Your diff touches EXACTLY 2 files, in this order:
1. `Blockchain/Dev/services/originate/src/originate.openapi.ts` - modified in place, `--- a/Blockchain/Dev/services/originate/src/originate.openapi.ts` / `+++ b/Blockchain/Dev/services/originate/src/originate.openapi.ts`, EXACTLY the 1 hunk given below, byte for byte.
