- RED KS-1364 VV1

## Cells and controls

- RED `RED KS-1364 VV1: POST /api/v2/verification/verify marks its request body required`: RED at the tip (undefined)
- green `control KS-1364 VC1: the v2 body keeps its schema and the route stays public (security [])`: green at the tip and after
