- The real router was not driven in-process; the absent-body 400 is read at source and measured on a byte-copied replica of the gate. The `authenticate({ required: false })` middleware (`:64`) runs first: with NO Authorization header it passes through (anonymous), which is the case Schemathesis's no-body request takes when it sends no token. Not re-run.
- The SERVED contract (`/api/docs/openapi.json` through the gateway) was not read.
